{"quest_id": 7175, "name": "女神の戯れ", "description": "王子は夢を見る。\nかつて戦ったケラウノスの夢を。\n夢の中で掴むのは、希望か絶望か。\n神級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv50）", "event": "集うは神の聖域", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920152, "map_no": 5768, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 75, "exp": 350, "gold": 2000, "drops": [{"card": 605, "c": 1}, {"card": 933, "c": 1}, {"card": 19, "c": 1}, {"card": 58, "c": 1}, {"item": 5003, "c": 3}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 60000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 60000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 1000, "magic_defense": 80, "attack_range": 220, "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 110, "attack_interval": 281, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "pattern_id": 2108320, "race_id": 19, "special_effect_id": 138, "missile_id": 85, "missile": {"slow": [99, 0]}, "master_id": 30198, "global_id": 3817, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 8, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 20000, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 20000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 500, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_range": 180, "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 110, "attack_interval": 281, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2110096, "race_id": 6, "special_effect_id": 138, "missile_id": 85, "missile": {"slow": [99, 0]}, "master_id": 30317, "global_id": 3936, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 10}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 81, "move_speed": 500.0, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2104640, "race_id": 16, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 2, "master_id": 561, "global_id": 560, "spawn_sec": 18}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 8000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 122, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2114288, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 30959, "global_id": 4578, "spawn_sec": 19}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 30000, "attack": 800, "base_hp": 30000, "base_attack": 800, "damage_type": "true", "armor_defense": 400, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_range": 120, "attack_wait": 8, "attack_interval": 98, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2122080, "race_id": 19, "special_effect_id": 107, "missile_id": 11, "master_id": 32433, "global_id": 6052, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 160}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["置物"], "fixture": true, "uncounted": true, "hp": 60000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 60000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 1000, "magic_defense": 80, "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 110, "attack_interval": 301, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "pattern_id": 2108320, "race_id": 19, "special_effect_id": 111, "missile_id": 85, "missile": {"slow": [99, 0]}, "master_id": 32960, "global_id": 6577, "spawn_sec": 240}], "popups": ["アダマスの幻影の攻撃は\n防御、魔法耐性を無視します。\nまた一定確率で攻撃を無効化、\n女神の加護：ダメージ軽減\nの影響を受けません。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "王子", "text": "…………（うとうと）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………？", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（きょろきょろ）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "――夢の中だからと油断しましたね、王子。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "今の数瞬で、かつての私なら\nあなたを数度は殺せたことでしょう。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "そろそろ、私を滅ぼしたことを、\n後悔している頃ではないかと思ったのですが――", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "――どうやら、まだ諦めてはいないようですね。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "ならば、少しだけ私の戯れに付き合いなさい。\nおとなしく滅んでいるのにも飽いた頃です。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "……はぁ。\n素直さは美徳のはずですが、気に入りませんね。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "では剣をとりなさい、王子。\n彼の神より力を分けし三女神が長姉、\nこのケラウノスが目を覚ましてやりましょう。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "――この場所に見覚えはありませんか。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "人の身で、神に手を届かせた場所です。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "たかが亜神の不死性ごときに、\nいったい何を悩んでいるのでしょう。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "女神ケラウノスを討ったその力を、\nもう忘れてしまったのですか？", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "覚えておきなさい。\n神は殺せるのだと、\n人の意志が、それを成し遂げた事実があるのだと。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "ならば、目覚めなさい。\n夢の帳の向こうでは、仲間が待っているのでしょう。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "……それから、これは純然たる興味なのですが。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "我が依代と、オーガスタは元気にしていますか？", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "……そう。\nならば、もう少し、安心して眠っていられそうです。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}, {"name": "ケラウノス", "text": "神の雷を滅ぼしたその力、\n天界にて存分に振るってきなさい、王子よ。", "face": "lae4bb54c7c45"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920152_5768", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 539, "y": 515}, {"k": "m", "x": 659, "y": 452, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 733, "y": 413, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 276, "y": 365, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 432, "y": 452, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 276, "y": 447, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 198, "y"